---
const footerLinks = [
  { label: "Inicio", href: "/" },
  { label: "Blog", href: "/blog" },
  { label: "Quiénes somos", href: "/#por-que-aura" },
  { label: "Términos", href: "/terminos-y-condiciones" },
  { label: "Privacidad", href: "/politicas-de-privacidad" },
  { label: "Transparencia", href: "/transparencia" },
  { label: "Soporte", href: "mailto:info@mintia.tech" },
];
---

<footer class="bg-ag-black border-t border-white/10">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-6 py-14 lg:px-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:justify-between">
      <div class="max-w-sm">
        <a href="/" class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-white">aura</a>
        <p class="mt-4 font-body text-sm text-white/60">
          La forma más simple y segura de proteger tu dinero con oro físico real desde el móvil. México y
          LATAM.
        </p>
      </div>

      <nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-3 font-body text-sm text-white/70">
        {
          footerLinks.map((link) => (
            <a href={link.href} class="hover:text-white transition-colors">
              {link.label}
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 font-body text-xs text-white/40 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between">
      <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} AuraGold - MintIA Corp. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
      <p>
        Developed by <a href="https://spacedev.io" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white">SpaceDev</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
